    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n7875" root="حزم" body-key="H">
    
      12 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِحْزَوْزَمَ</span></b> , (K,) from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الحَزْمُ</span>; like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِعْشَوْشَبَ</span>,
from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">العُشْبُ</span>; (TA;) <i>It</i> (a place) <i>was,</i> or <i>became,
rough,</i> or <i>rugged:</i> (K:) or <i>elevated.</i> (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <i>It
was,</i> or <i>became, collected together, and compacted,</i>
or <i>compact.</i> (K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <i>He</i> (a man) <i>was,</i> or <i>became,
big,</i> or <i>large, in the belly, without being full.</i> (K,
TA.)

